This project generalizes the SAP test agents (sap-planner / sap-generator /
sap-healer) of the SAPFX project (same author, Apache-2.0) into
technology-agnostic Robot Framework agents. The plan → generate → heal cycle
transposes the concept of Playwright Test Agents (Microsoft, Apache-2.0) to
the Robot Framework ecosystem; no Playwright code is included.

scripts/check_spec_sync.py is adapted from the guard of the same name in the
SAPFX project (Apache-2.0).

The agents drive applications through the rf-mcp / RobotMCP server
(https://github.com/manykarim/robotmcp), which is a runtime dependency, not
vendored code.
